 nav:{home:"Home",categories:"Product categories",products:"Product details",articles:"SEO articles",faq:"FAQ",language:"Language"},announcement:"Inspection version · 02 September 2026 · Research for Europe & North America",footer:"Independent discovery experience. Product, payment and shipping details should be checked before an order.",categoryLead:"Choose a category to read its purpose before opening the matching main-site results.",productLead:"Start with a focused product group, then continue to its matching main-site category.",articleLead:"Clear, practical reading for researching listings, product details and delivery options.",faqLead:"Short answers for researching before you search.",detail:"Category details",category:"Category",allCategories:"All categories",openCategory:"Open this category",openDetails:"Open details",openArticles:"Open articles",readArticle:"Read article",categoryIntro:"This page gives visitors clear category context before moving to the corresponding FindSpreadsheet results.",categoryAside:"Open the matching category and continue your search on the main site.",productPrefix:"DETAIL",faq:[["Can I search LoloBuy with a product link or product name?","The public homepage search field says it accepts a product link or product name. Check the live result before making a decision."],["What does the public workflow show after payment?","The homepage presents order payment, warehouse quality inspection and storage, then quality check and combined delivery."],["Does LoloBuy advertise QC pictures?","Yes. Its public warehouse-stage text advertises free quality-inspection pictures. Review the live pictures against your own checklist."],["Does QC mean the item is guaranteed to be perfect?","No. QC images are evidence to review, not a promise that every detail or outcome is guaranteed."],["What storage period is publicly advertised?","The homepage currently advertises 180 days of free storage. Recheck the live terms before relying on it."],["Can warehouse items be combined?","The public site says selected warehouse goods can be submitted as a single parcel. Whether that suits an order depends on live options and destination."],["Is a freight estimate a final price?","No. Use it as an estimate. The live parcel, destination, available line and item characteristics can affect the final choice."],["Does this site promise shipping time or customs clearance?","No. It does not make shipping-time, customs, route or final-cost promises."],["Where do database buttons go?","Every database button on this inspection site opens the FindSpreadsheet homepage only."],["How should I make a first order safer to evaluate?","Use one clearly identified item, save the link and variation, prepare a QC checklist, then check live parcel options before submission."]],
 home:{steps:[["Choose destination","Start with your delivery country before comparing routes."],["Check the details","Use listing information and quality-control photos before deciding."],["Search the database","Continue to FindSpreadsheet to review matching listings."]],trust:["Nine complete language versions","Main-site search only"],routeCards:["Product research","Route & details","FindSpreadsheet"],facts:[["Platform workflow","Source shopping, warehouse delivery, parcel options and tracking are described in the public product flow."],["Destination-sensitive","A shipping line, cost and restrictions must be checked for the selected country at the time of shipping."],["Useful before checkout","Compare product details, sizing notes and route choices before paying."]],categoryBlurb:"Each category opens its matching FindSpreadsheet results directly.",articleTag:"WORKFLOW",articleTitle:"LoloBuy first-order research guide",articleText:"Public workflow facts, QC preparation and freight-estimate checks without invented promises.",homeFaq:[["Is this site affiliated with LoloBuy?","No. This is an independent research and discovery page. It sends visitors to FindSpreadsheet for database searching."],["Do the same shipping lines work for every country?","No. Check destination-specific options and the live estimate before you submit a parcel."],["Why are there nine language versions?","They are designed for the main European and North American visitor groups; each version keeps the same research structure."]]},article:englishArticle
